Choose the field of engineering that interests you. There are several different types of engineers. Spend some time thinking about what kind of job you want and then choose your specialty based on that. You can ask your academic advisor to go over the different options with you. Some of the most common fields include: Civil engineering. This career involves planning and completing infrastructure projects, such as highways and bridges. Electrical engineering. The focus in this field is inventing and improving the electrical functions of machines like cell phones and cameras. Mechanical engineering.
